{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2023-04/1066222/block/singleImage/3280861/df/14-5_4.jpg?updatedAt=1795842742\"/><figcaption>一名35歲周姓男保安員在綠楊坊地下一間保安室暈倒。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日（28日）凌晨4時許，一名35歲周姓男保安員在蕙荃路22至66號商場「綠楊坊」地下一間保安室暈倒，同事發現後報案，周男昏迷由救護車送院搶救，最終不治，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T05:23:50.539052+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T04:05:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T14:33:17.457798+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T05:17:14.492166+00:00","content_hash":"935430c20754159e50e4546741a95c05cc94114afe8635c14b8cb32ed4004f1c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-28T05:23:50.539052+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}